# Everything in this repo runs exclusively on Debian/Ubuntu Linux (the sink
# Droplet, the PMM server). Force LF line endings for everything checked in,
# regardless of what OS/editor a contributor commits from (e.g. Windows +
# VS Code, which defaults to CRLF). This travels with the repo via git and
# applies to every clone/CI run — unlike a personal VS Code "files.eol"
# setting or a local `git config core.autocrlf`, which only affect one
# machine and are easy to forget to set up on a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
